{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>To be to you for Elohim and to your seed after you.</b> To unify My name upon you without intermediary, as He is unified upon all eternal beings, as it says: כִּי כָל אֲשֶׁר יַעֲשֶׂה הָאֱלֹהִים הוּא יִהְיֶה לְעוֹלָם (Ecclesiastes 3:14) — for indeed, perishable beings, insofar as they perish, are not His direct product but through intermediary. He said, therefore, that through the establishment of the covenant and its observance, he and his seed would be eternal in the man before Him."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:25.257429301Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}